WEBVTT

00:00:28.660 --> 00:00:30.250
What the heck?

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:14.950
"Runaway Girl x Attacker"

00:02:15.450 --> 00:02:19.160
Genzo, we've finally got a house,

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:22.870
but if you don't do something
we won't have any place to live!

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:24.290
Listen, Shigure.

00:02:24.290 --> 00:02:28.080
Until these kids grow up to live
with their wonderful owners,

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.120
we need to make sacrifices
for the sake of our love for them.

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.450
That's what it means to be a parent.

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:36.330
I'm no parent to a demon beast.

00:02:36.330 --> 00:02:39.080
And they cost a ton to feed, too.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.870
Okay, I'm off to pawn these
and take a look at the guild board.

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:47.370
There might be something
high-paying we can do for a job.

00:02:52.580 --> 00:02:55.250
Oh, you guys must be hungry!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.370
There's plenty to eat, so chow down!

00:03:05.660 --> 00:03:10.410
The road to my pet shop dream
is still a long and hard one, huh?

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:13.450
Oh? You're the new neighbor, huh?

00:03:13.450 --> 00:03:14.830
Looks like you're working hard.

00:03:14.830 --> 00:03:15.830
Yes...

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.330
Are you all right?

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.450
I'm just fine, miss.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:31.120
I'm glad.

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:35.830
Um... I have to hurry and go shopping.

00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:37.290
Bye!

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:40.410
Miss!

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:47.700
What a charming lady!

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.200
What's up, Hiroyuki?

00:03:56.410 --> 00:03:58.660
What's this?

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:03.000
She has a wonderful tail and horns of her own!

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:04.790
"Growl..."

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.200
Where am I?

00:04:22.580 --> 00:04:25.620
Looks like you're awake.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.250
Food's ready.

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:29.750
Here.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:35.040
This is all I have,
but it's better than nothing, right?

00:04:35.040 --> 00:04:37.160
Um...

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:39.200
Can I eat it?

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:40.290
Yes.

00:04:40.290 --> 00:04:43.870
Thank your luscious horns and tail.

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:49.750
I thought humans always get
scared when they see these...

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:52.830
Nice to meet you, strange human.

00:04:52.830 --> 00:04:55.870
My name is Lindabulea. Fa--

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:57.830
Fa?

00:04:57.830 --> 00:05:00.500
Just Lindabulea.

00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.870
I'm a half-dragon. A nobody.

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.910
A half-dragon?

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:08.450
Yes. A completely ordinary half-dragon!

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:09.370
I see!

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:11.410
I'm Genzo Shibata.

00:05:10.750 --> 00:05:12.290
"Growl..."

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:16.330
Sorry. Eat up.

00:05:16.330 --> 00:05:18.700
Okay! Thank you!

00:05:19.870 --> 00:05:22.160
No! Not him!

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:23.790
This!

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:25.950
Oh, this is dinner?

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:29.910
He just looked so delicious.

00:05:29.910 --> 00:05:32.580
I can't have you eating my partner--

00:05:34.660 --> 00:05:36.200
You're fast.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:40.660
By the way, Genzo, these monsters...

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:45.790
Yeah. I'm raising them so I can achieve
my dream of opening a pet shop.

00:05:45.790 --> 00:05:47.870
A pet shop?

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.160
I see!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.660
You mean a restaurant, right?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:52.660
No!

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:56.290
This salamander looks especially delicious!

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.200
Listen to me.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.790
Listen carefully.

00:05:59.790 --> 00:06:02.700
A pet shop is a place where you
train the pets you've found,

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:04.870
sometimes with a whip and
sometimes with a carrot,

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:08.870
so you can someday sell them to good homes!

00:06:08.870 --> 00:06:12.700
This world doesn't seem to have
the concept of keeping animals as pets.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:17.500
But any living creature will respect you
if you treat it with love.

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:23.250
I want to teach the world that
humans and animals can coexist!

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:25.200
Genzo!

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:32.830
What kind of demon beast is this?

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:34.830
His name is Hiroyuki.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:37.160
He's not an animal. He's a mongrel.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.080
A mongrel...

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:44.410
May I have him, Genzo?

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.750
I'll raise him with love!

00:06:46.750 --> 00:06:48.450
But he's...

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.870
I'll raise him with love and care...

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:55.200
And get him nice and plump and...

00:06:55.200 --> 00:06:59.000
I knew you were going to eat him!

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:00.870
You meanie!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:06.450
Do all half-dragons try to eat everything?

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:10.410
I still can't read well.

00:07:10.410 --> 00:07:13.700
Tell me what page the half-dragons are on.

00:07:18.290 --> 00:07:21.450
I forgot something important I had to do.

00:07:21.450 --> 00:07:24.500
Bye, Genzo!

00:07:25.410 --> 00:07:27.790
What's her deal?

00:07:29.250 --> 00:07:32.000
What's wrong? Did you forget something?

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:33.700
Oh, it's you, Shigure.

00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:35.830
Yes. I just got back--

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.540
A dragon! I smell a dragon!

00:07:38.540 --> 00:07:43.870
Genzo! We're already almost broke,
and you brought in a dragon?

00:07:43.870 --> 00:07:46.250
I did not bring in a dragon!

00:07:46.250 --> 00:07:49.870
I just made some food
for a half-dragon, that's all!

00:07:49.870 --> 00:07:51.410
I see.

00:07:51.410 --> 00:07:56.200
But the dragon smell is pretty
strong for a half-dragon...

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:59.910
By the way, did you find any high-paying jobs?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.120
A suspicious person?

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:09.790
Yes. People are getting attacked
every night, we're hearing.

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:12.200
They want to hire the guild to help.

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.330
Not interested. Ask somebody else.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:15.910
Hey, Genzo!

00:08:15.910 --> 00:08:18.500
It wasn't a man that did it!
It was a demon beast!

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:20.330
Let's hear the details.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:27.290
At first I thought what he said was just
the ramblings of a drunk, but...

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:32.120
Those big wings, those sharp fangs,

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:33.450
those ferocious eyes...

00:08:33.450 --> 00:08:35.750
That was a dragon! I know it!

00:08:35.750 --> 00:08:39.450
A dragon that eats anything,
from a demon beast to a rock!

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.450
I've never seen one and I
don't know what they look like,

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.870
but I'm pretty sure that it was
absolutely, probably a dragon!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:47.950
A dragon! Something that amazing
is here, in this town...

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.080
A dragon?

00:08:49.080 --> 00:08:50.950
Didn't I just hear that...?

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:53.830
I heard the story.

00:08:53.830 --> 00:08:57.870
I, Heat Haze, can't turn down
the chance to fight a dragon.

00:08:57.870 --> 00:09:01.200
This is the perfect chance to gain
the title of dragon slayer.

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:06.910
I will defeat the evil dragon
with my new magic sword, Dainsleif!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:11.870
Let us battle the dragon together, my friend!

00:09:13.700 --> 00:09:15.790
Hell no!

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:20.370
Yay! Another sword somebody forgot!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:23.330
Only you could handle a dragon!

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:24.950
Please, demon beast killer.

00:09:24.950 --> 00:09:30.910
I told you not to call me that!

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:34.910
Okay, let's go, Shigure.

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:36.620
First we'll investigate the scene.

00:09:36.620 --> 00:09:39.750
Maybe we'll find some dropped scales...

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:42.950
Even hearing it was a dragon didn't scare him.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.580
Just what you'd expect
from the demon beast--

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:52.080
What's up?

00:09:52.080 --> 00:09:53.910
I'm sure of it!

00:09:53.910 --> 00:09:56.120
This is the smell of a dragon!

00:09:56.120 --> 00:09:57.040
Really?

00:09:57.040 --> 00:10:00.750
And it's the same thing
I smelled in our house before.

00:10:00.750 --> 00:10:02.000
What?

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:06.540
Genzo, who was it who came to our house?

00:10:08.450 --> 00:10:12.750
My wrestler's intuition is telling me
that she wasn't the culprit.

00:10:12.750 --> 00:10:17.750
But Shigure's sharp nose would never
make a mistake. Which means...

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:22.660
It's possible that the girl
is caught up in some kind of crime.

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.040
It's time to go.

00:10:37.160 --> 00:10:42.620
Okay, now to just put down
this special extra-dry pet food...

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:47.040
If I'm wrong and she really
was attacking people,

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:49.160
I'll capture her myself.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:52.540
This outfit is a symbol of my resolve!

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.910
She was very hungry.

00:10:54.910 --> 00:10:57.330
Normally she wouldn't fall for a trap like this,

00:10:57.330 --> 00:10:58.750
but she won't be able to resist the smell--

00:10:58.750 --> 00:11:02.370
And what happens when I
can't resist the smell?

00:11:04.750 --> 00:11:07.870
You're sure you're a half-dragon, right?

00:11:07.870 --> 00:11:09.120
Yes.

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:13.410
Anyway, who are you? Have we met?

00:11:13.410 --> 00:11:15.910
My name is Animal Mask!

00:11:15.910 --> 00:11:18.500
Just an ordinary, run-of-the-mill wrestler!

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.000
But I have something to ask you...

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.700
Stop eating, first.

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.040
No.

00:11:25.830 --> 00:11:30.200
What are you doing out here, Animal Mask?

00:11:30.200 --> 00:11:33.160
I set a trap to catch you!

00:11:34.200 --> 00:11:37.580
What will you do now that you've captured me?

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:39.330
Will you...?

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:43.080
No! I'll admit your tail
and horns are attractive,

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:44.950
but I'm not a lolicon!

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:47.410
A pervert has appeared!

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.080
Look! He's clearly a weirdo!

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:53.700
The man in the cape
threw a woman in a cage!

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.950
W-Wait! I'm not the suspicious person!

00:11:56.950 --> 00:11:59.700
It's the middle of the night and
you've got a loli stuck in a cage!

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:01.330
How is that not suspicious?

00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:03.660
That's the definition of suspicious!

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.330
Oh, no!

00:12:05.330 --> 00:12:08.040
They're absolutely right!

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:11.330
Damn! How did this happen?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.580
I just wanted to help that girl!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:18.450
You think they thought you were trying
to trap me and have your way with me?

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:21.950
I would never do that to a girl...

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.870
Wait!

00:12:24.870 --> 00:12:26.620
Where did you go?

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.120
Hey.

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:32.370
What happened to the cage?

00:12:32.370 --> 00:12:36.290
I pulled hard and the bars separated.

00:12:36.290 --> 00:12:38.000
You tore up the cage yourself?

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:41.160
Are you really a half-dragon?

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:45.200
And why are you running away with me?

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:48.790
You said you had something to ask me, right?

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:49.950
And...

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:54.080
You didn't seem like a bad person.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:57.250
Get away from the mistress, pervert.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.910
Who's that?

00:12:59.910 --> 00:13:01.370
Carmilla...

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:05.790
You suspicious pervert... I shall defeat you!

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:10.500
Foolish human... your struggles
will only prolong your suffering.

00:13:11.620 --> 00:13:13.410
Stop it! Don't throw rocks!

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.040
That's not fair!

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:19.830
And mistress, were you throwing rocks too?

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.620
Is she with you?

00:13:21.620 --> 00:13:23.250
I've never seen her in my life.

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.660
Mistress!

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:26.330
You just said her name was Carmilla, though.

00:13:26.330 --> 00:13:28.200
Sure you didn't imagine it?

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:31.410
Damn you!

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:36.200
I'll rip you apart for trying
to deceive the mistress.

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:37.370
What?

00:13:37.370 --> 00:13:44.080
That's nothing compared to the claws of the
cruel wrestler I once fought, Jack the Rapper!

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.950
A mere human trying to match my strength?

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:51.160
I'll snap those arms of yours...

00:13:51.160 --> 00:13:53.040
Huh?

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:55.540
She's tough...

00:13:57.790 --> 00:14:00.200
My name is Animal Mask!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:04.410
When I bear this name and wear these clothes...

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:08.790
Oww! Oww! Are you really human?

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.410
Animal Mask!

00:14:10.410 --> 00:14:13.000
I cannot be defeated!

00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.790
You're going to break something!

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:15.750
I hear voices!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.830
This way! Bring more people!

00:14:17.830 --> 00:14:19.660
Surround him!

00:14:19.660 --> 00:14:20.660
Let's go!

00:14:20.660 --> 00:14:21.950
Right!

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:26.290
I'll get you yet!

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:28.080
Where did that pervert go?

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.410
He should be nearby.

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:30.250
Let's find him!

00:14:30.250 --> 00:14:31.250
Right!

00:14:33.790 --> 00:14:34.830
They're persistent.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:36.540
What do we do?

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:38.910
We'll have to get creative.

00:14:40.290 --> 00:14:41.580
What's this?

00:14:41.580 --> 00:14:44.330
They're looking for a masked man.

00:14:44.330 --> 00:14:49.500
But if you wear this, we'll just
look like an ordinary masked couple.

00:14:49.500 --> 00:14:50.750
I see!

00:14:50.750 --> 00:14:55.540
I heard that humans were smart!
That's a brilliant idea!

00:14:55.540 --> 00:14:58.040
My name can be Maskoffsky.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.790
And you can be... Hanako!

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:03.450
Destroyer Hanako!

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:04.950
Hanako!

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:07.290
Okay, got it!

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:12.950
Hey, glad to see you're
keeping the streets safe.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.700
Everybody seems panicked about something.
Did something happen?

00:15:15.700 --> 00:15:19.290
Well, there's a suspicious person around here...

00:15:19.290 --> 00:15:21.620
Genzo, what are you doing?

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:23.250
Nope!

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.870
I don't know who you're confusing me with,

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:27.660
but my name is Maskoffsky!

00:15:27.660 --> 00:15:29.120
And this is...

00:15:29.120 --> 00:15:31.290
...Destroyer Hanako!

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:35.160
What is it, Shigure?

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:39.120
Nothing! Nothing!

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:44.200
I forgot something, so I'm going home!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:45.160
Get moving!

00:15:45.160 --> 00:15:46.450
Hey!

00:15:47.700 --> 00:15:49.790
What the hell are you doing?

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.700
Wait, Shigure...

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:53.500
I just wanted her to...

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:56.620
You were actually Genzo?

00:15:56.620 --> 00:15:58.540
You couldn't tell?

00:15:58.540 --> 00:16:03.870
Listen, Shigure. You may have seen through
my disguise with your sharp nose,

00:16:03.870 --> 00:16:05.830
but when I wear the mask
I'm a different person.

00:16:05.830 --> 00:16:07.910
Normal people can't tell.

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.540
You sure about that?

00:16:10.540 --> 00:16:12.950
So, the issue is you.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:15.040
I've got questions.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:17.870
Okay.

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:21.160
My name is Lindabulea.

00:16:21.160 --> 00:16:23.040
Fafnir Gildomela Grind...

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.160
Hold it!

00:16:25.160 --> 00:16:26.450
Genzo!

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:28.870
I'm going to go clean my room.

00:16:28.870 --> 00:16:29.950
Don't be ridiculous.

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:32.250
This is important, so listen carefully.

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.410
B-But...

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:36.500
I'm a member of the Fafnir family,

00:16:36.500 --> 00:16:39.200
one of the four families
that serve the Demon King...

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.370
Be quiet, Shigure. What's your problem?

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.250
We're doomed!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.830
Now that we've heard that we're...

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.080
Wh-What?

00:16:52.660 --> 00:16:55.370
Is that...?

00:16:55.370 --> 00:16:57.120
You're the girl from before!

00:16:57.120 --> 00:17:00.000
My name is Vanstein Carmilla!

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:02.410
You are in the presence of the mistress.

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:06.160
Now kneel before her.

00:17:06.160 --> 00:17:07.410
This person is...

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:11.040
A while ago I was defeated by
a masked human.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:12.910
Where did he go?

00:17:12.910 --> 00:17:16.160
I thought he was with the mistress.

00:17:16.160 --> 00:17:17.250
Masked man?

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:18.950
Did you meet her before?

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:21.950
Yeah. I beat her, too.

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:25.290
That stupid mask fooled her too?

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:27.540
More importantly!

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:30.540
Carmilla, these two
have nothing to do with this!

00:17:30.540 --> 00:17:32.950
I'll go back, so don't...

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:37.330
No! All information about
the Fafnir family is top secret!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:41.410
Now that it's leaked,
this human will have to disappear.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:44.950
I didn't even ask! You just told me!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:49.250
Genzo, use this on her!

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:50.660
What is this?

00:17:50.660 --> 00:17:52.450
Just do it!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:55.620
Now, foolish lesser beings!

00:17:55.620 --> 00:17:57.750
Tonight will be your last night!

00:17:57.750 --> 00:18:01.830
If nothing else, know that you died
in the presence of my great mistress...

00:18:01.830 --> 00:18:03.870
Oww!

00:18:05.160 --> 00:18:08.160
That's holy water
with the church's mark on it! It works!

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.700
Genzo, here!

00:18:11.700 --> 00:18:14.250
Stuff it in her mouth!

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.080
I don't understand, but sure!

00:18:17.080 --> 00:18:18.790
Garlic!

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:22.000
How could you?

00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.080
Wait!

00:18:24.080 --> 00:18:26.950
Can you forgive her?

00:18:26.950 --> 00:18:30.830
She's an idiot, but she's
an important servant of mine.

00:18:33.410 --> 00:18:34.790
I see.

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:39.750
So Carmilla came to bring you back
after you ran away?

00:18:39.750 --> 00:18:40.700
Indeed.

00:18:40.700 --> 00:18:46.620
I followed her scent to this town,
but she was always one step ahead.

00:18:46.620 --> 00:18:50.580
But now I've finally found her.

00:18:50.580 --> 00:18:52.870
I see.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:55.620
Now let's hear what you
have to say for yourself.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:18:58.500
Um, were you listening?

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:02.000
She's the daughter of the Fafnir family...

00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:04.410
I'm not interested in the Fafna-whatsits.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:06.870
I want to hear why you ran away from home.

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:09.500
No, I'm going home, so don't worry.

00:19:09.500 --> 00:19:11.000
Fool!

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:12.370
Whatever reason it was,

00:19:12.370 --> 00:19:15.500
it was enough for a kid like you to wander
around in the middle of the night!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:18.450
Will you really have no regrets if you go back?

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:20.910
Tell me what you really want!

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:29.250
I was sick of spending every day in the mansion.

00:19:29.250 --> 00:19:31.200
And spending every day

00:19:31.200 --> 00:19:35.950
learning to kill humans as
the daughter of the Fafnir family...

00:19:35.950 --> 00:19:38.290
Mistress...

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:40.620
And every day it's orc meat!

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:43.830
And if it's not that,
it's goblin meat or troll meat!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:45.790
I'm sick of it!

00:19:46.450 --> 00:19:48.870
I wanted to go into the outside world

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:53.290
and sample all kinds of new, tasty treats!

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:55.160
Is that why?

00:19:55.160 --> 00:19:56.580
But...

00:19:56.580 --> 00:19:59.660
It was fate that led me to this town.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:01.040
Mistress?

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.660
I... I...

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.700
Fate? Does that mean...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:08.950
Mistress! You can't, mistress!

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:10.700
I won't let you, mistress!

00:20:10.700 --> 00:20:11.660
Genzo!

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:12.450
What?

00:20:12.450 --> 00:20:16.660
Let me help you with your pet shop!

00:20:16.660 --> 00:20:19.580
Rethink that, mistress!

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:22.370
No, I've made my choice!

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:25.000
Fate led me to meet you!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.330
No matter what anybody says,
I won't change my mind.

00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:34.500
So, can I stay by your side, Hiroyuki?

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.200
Him, not me?

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.660
Very well.

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:44.790
I'll tell the clan leader.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:47.250
You're sure, Carmilla?

00:20:47.250 --> 00:20:52.790
Yes. My highest priority is your happiness.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:54.250
Wait!

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:57.620
We haven't even opened the store!
We don't have money to hire anybody!

00:20:57.620 --> 00:21:01.040
As long as I have food and a place to live,
I don't need money.

00:21:01.040 --> 00:21:01.950
You're hired.

00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:03.040
Very well.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:07.700
But we can't call you Lindabulea
or Fafna-whatsits, right?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.370
Um...

00:21:09.370 --> 00:21:10.200
Call me Hanako!

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:13.500
Just call me Hanako from now on!

00:21:13.500 --> 00:21:14.500
You're sure?

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.450
Yes!

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:17.790
Okay! Glad to have you aboard.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:21.660
Hey, so who was the suspicious person, then?

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:23.080
Suspicious person?

00:21:23.080 --> 00:21:26.040
You didn't attack any people, did you?

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:27.160
How rude!

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:29.790
Even I don't eat people.

00:21:29.790 --> 00:21:33.370
Humans are omnivores so they
don't taste good, I've heard.

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:35.910
And you didn't try to find out
by biting one, right?

00:21:35.910 --> 00:21:39.500
The people who were attacked
had bite marks on them.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.870
Oh, that was me.

00:21:42.540 --> 00:21:44.080
What do you mean?

00:21:44.080 --> 00:21:48.830
While I was chasing after your smell,
I kind of got excited.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:51.660
So I attacked some passing humans.

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:54.410
Keep it our secret, okay?

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:58.410
It was you?

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:09.540
Genzo, bubbles are coming out of her mouth!

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:10.660
She's a crab?

00:22:09.540 --> 00:22:10.660
Genzo, bubbles are coming out of her mouth!

00:22:10.660 --> 00:22:12.200
She's not a crab, she's Carmilla!

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.950
Genzo, don't you think it's time for snacks?

00:23:45.870 --> 00:23:48.620
Next time: "Demon Beast x Part-Time Job."
